            <span class="mono">Requirements & Notes <em>(Optional)</em></span>
            <textarea
              name="requirements"
              rows="4"
              placeholder="Describe your current tech stack, timelines, key features, or specific deliverables needed..."
            ></textarea>
          </label>

          <div class="modal-info-callout">
            <span class="mono">NOTE</span>
            <p>
              Your request will be registered with status <strong>Pending</strong> in your service pipeline. Our team will review the specifications and assign engineers before activation.
            </p>
